Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=32}========================== DIALOGUE ==================================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.34,0:01:53.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.72,0:01:56.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When the hell are we\Ngonna reach land anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.10,0:01:57.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.10,0:02:00.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're just sailin' on the wind and\Nthe waves, goin' where they take us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.77,0:02:04.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you find it dumb that someone\Ntrying to be King of the Pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.65,0:02:06.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,doesn't have a single\Nnavigational skill?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.98,0:02:08.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not really...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.36,0:02:10.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just drift around...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.36,0:02:14.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}What about you? Aren't you some\Nfamous bounty hunter who sailed the seas?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.11,0:02:17.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't have any recollection\Nof ever calling myself a bounty hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.24,0:02:22.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I set out onto the open sea\Nin search of just one man,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.33,0:02:24.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but then I couldn't\Nget back to my village.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.21,0:02:28.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,By that point, I had no choice but to\Ngo after pirate ships to earn a living.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.80,0:02:30.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. So you're just lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.80,0:02:32.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't put it like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.93,0:02:40.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Another big haul today!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.97,0:02:42.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's two in a row!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.10,0:02:45.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All of this should keep Buggy\Nfrom getting too mad at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.14,0:02:45.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.94,0:02:48.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's with that boat out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.23,0:02:49.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.98,0:02:53.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We should check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.04,0:03:08.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh... It's a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.67,0:03:11.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, wake up little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.51,0:03:14.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.26,0:03:17.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please tell me I'm not\Ndreaming this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.05,0:03:20.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Finding help out here\Nin the middle of nowhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.22,0:03:23.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you're real, then please,\Ncould you get me some water?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.31,0:03:25.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm so thirsty...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.81,0:03:28.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll give you as much jewelry\Nand valuables as you like,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.52,0:03:30.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,if you could just\Ngive me one little drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.65,0:03:32.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No sweat. We'll help ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.86,0:03:36.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But not until we see what kinda\Ntreasure you're holding on to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.28,0:03:37.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, don't mind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.61,0:03:38.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll just be a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.08,0:03:43.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can't get the damn thing open!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:44.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh. Hold up, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.17,0:03:52.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you want, you can\Nkeep the whole thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.42,0:03:53.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not my style.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.76,0:03:56.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But that's our boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.01,0:03:57.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You tricked us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.93,0:04:02.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}From the look of those clouds moving in\Nfrom the south, I'd say a cold front's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.81,0:04:07.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}So you can probably expect strong winds\Nand squalls any time now, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.94,0:04:11.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Also, in that small a boat,\Nyou run a bit of a chance of capsizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.07,0:04:22.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.41,0:04:24.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.99,0:04:27.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll just take whatever\Ntreasure you guys got here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.75,0:04:29.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get back here, you bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.75,0:04:31.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll get you for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.38,0:04:35.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh. I am so hungry. It's killing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.80,0:04:37.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.80,0:04:39.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, a bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.76,0:04:41.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know! Let's eat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.76,0:04:43.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? How do we catch it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.39,0:04:44.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leave that to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.72,0:04:47.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.60,0:04:49.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.44,0:04:51.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Makes sense...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.90,0:04:55.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.15,0:05:01.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.41,0:05:03.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You moron! What the\Nhell's goin' on now?!
Comment: 0,0:05:04.95,0:05:05.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HENCHMAN A]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.75,0:05:10.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, you there! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.71,0:05:13.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please! Men overboard!\NStop! Men overboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.46,0:05:16.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I find\Nship-wreckers at a time like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.75,0:05:18.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't stop, you're just\Ngonna have to jump in!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.34,0:05:20.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.43,0:05:25.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm actually impressed\Nyou made it onboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.30,0:05:26.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to kill us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.14,0:05:29.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop the boat now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.27,0:05:33.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The three of us are members\Nof Buggy the Clown's pirate crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.02,0:05:34.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This boat is ours now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.48,0:05:36.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.07,0:05:39.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.61,0:05:43.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We had no idea you were\Nthe famous Pirate Hunter Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.36,0:05:45.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please forgive us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.24,0:05:48.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you three idiots,\NI lost sight of my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.37,0:05:50.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So just keep paddling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.12,0:05:51.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.21,0:05:52.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Knowing Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.58,0:05:55.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,he'll probably pull off\N{\i1}something{\i0} once he spots land.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.84,0:06:00.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, any ideas about what we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.59,0:06:01.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.80,0:06:06.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}If Captain Buggy finds out a {\i1}girl{\i0} stole\Nour boat and our treasure, we're history.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.76,0:06:07.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.81,0:06:10.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? So who is this Buggy guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.02,0:06:13.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh... You've never heard\Nof Buggy the Clown?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.27,0:06:14.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.60,0:06:17.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's the ruthless captain\Nof our pirate ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.61,0:06:19.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And he's eaten one of the devil fruits!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.48,0:06:24.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1519)}But above everything else,\Nhe is a one truly terrifying man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.92,0:06:44.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, I've finally got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.38,0:06:46.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey girl, get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.06,0:06:48.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You better give us\Nthat map back or else!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.64,0:06:50.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We just stole\Nthat chart of the Grand Line!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.64,0:06:52.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It belongs to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.68,0:06:53.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.98,0:06:56.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we don't get that thing back,\Nthen we're as good as dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.48,0:06:59.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll be killed by one of\Nthe Captain's cannonballs!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.82,0:07:05.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.24,0:07:07.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've spotted something high\Nin the sky above the port.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.24,0:07:09.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, shoot it down!
Comment: 0,0:07:12.87,0:07:14.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GIRL]\NAh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.12,0:07:17.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.47,0:07:28.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What... was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.93,0:07:30.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.55,0:07:32.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A guy fell from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.89,0:07:33.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dammit...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.64,0:07:36.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why were there\Ncannonballs flying at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.86,0:07:43.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At least I'm safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.44,0:07:44.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.62,0:07:46.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,what just happened to me\Nwas {\i1}awesome{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.41,0:07:51.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.74,0:07:54.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.91,0:07:53.29,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.29,0:07:55.04,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming to save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.04,0:07:55.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.00,0:07:57.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who're you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.21,0:08:01.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're all yours now, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.71,0:08:02.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Have fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.55,0:08:06.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! That girl's getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.96,0:08:09.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's okay.\NWe've got her boss now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.05,0:08:10.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're in trouble, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.93,0:08:13.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You shoulda let\Nyour crony fend for herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.43,0:08:15.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You guys know of anywhere\Ngood to eat around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.93,0:08:17.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Food's the least of\Nyour worries now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.86,0:08:30.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You better keep your\Nhands off my hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.03,0:08:31.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.78,0:08:33.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wonder if they've\Nkilled that poor guy yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.87,0:08:38.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.67,0:08:45.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.38,0:08:47.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're really strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.38,0:08:48.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.26,0:08:53.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even though both of them had sabers,\Nyou beat them barehanded.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.35,0:08:55.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! You're the girl who set me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.14,0:08:56.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.64,0:08:59.39,Main-207-,,0,0,11,,I'm a talented thief\Nwho steals strictly from pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.39,0:09:00.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The name's Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.52,0:09:02.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey... Wanna team up with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.90,0:09:05.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Um, thanks anyway, lady,\Nbut I think I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.78,0:09:08.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.65,0:09:11.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At least think about it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.45,0:09:16.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're telling me they\Nstill haven't caught the thief?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.62,0:09:17.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.54,0:09:18.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.54,0:09:19.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.66,0:09:21.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But they should be in pursuit...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:23.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,right now, Captain... Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.17,0:09:28.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\q2}Now explain to me, how in the world did she\Nmanage to get her hands on that chart, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.13,0:09:33.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we're preparing to enter\Nthe Grand Line, and go on a rampage,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.97,0:09:36.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,then why wasn't the chart\Nproperly guarded?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.01,0:09:37.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I-I don't know, sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.39,0:09:40.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The map was just sitting out,\Nplain as the nose on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.23,0:09:42.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.02,0:09:44.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I-I mean it was easy for\Nher to find and take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.98,0:09:47.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you say something\Nabout my nose?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.86,0:09:49.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.11,0:09:51.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to tell me\Nyou find my nose funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.86,0:09:54.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is my nose amusing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.03,0:09:55.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, sir, you've misunderstood!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.83,0:09:58.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, you were {\i1}quite{\i0} clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.25,0:10:02.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Help me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.17,0:10:09.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This isn't good...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.55,0:10:11.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's... gonna use the devil fruit power!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.14,0:10:19.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me, who am I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.56,0:10:23.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.44,0:10:25.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Buggy...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.36,0:10:30.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And what happens\Nif someone defies me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.73,0:10:37.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Flashy... death... awaits... them...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.66,0:10:41.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please... forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.37,0:10:45.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Quit your groveling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.12,0:10:48.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll overlook your slip-up\Nand forgive you this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.79,0:10:50.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But you better get that chart back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.75,0:10:53.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't screw up again... Or else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.51,0:10:55.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, Captain Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.31,0:11:02.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yum.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.27,0:11:04.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, do you live in this\Nbig house all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.77,0:11:07.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This isn't my house, I'm just\Nstaying here for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.27,0:11:11.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone's left this town\Nbecause of Captain Buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.19,0:11:12.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So you're just a petty thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.86,0:11:14.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.07,0:11:17.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I only steal from people\Nwho deserve it: pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.32,0:11:20.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So don't compare me\Nto some scumbag, petty thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.08,0:11:23.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A thief's a thief,\Nas far as I'm concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.25,0:11:29.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}My goal is to earn a hundred million berries,\Nno matter how hard it is, or how long it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.38,0:11:30.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.25,0:11:32.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you need\Nso many berries for anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.63,0:11:34.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.22,0:11:36.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But with this chart of the Grand Line...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.59,0:11:39.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the hundred million is\Nnow a definite possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.26,0:11:41.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A chart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.35,0:11:42.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So you must be a navigator.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.56,0:11:46.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm the most skilled navigator\Nyou're ever likely to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.27,0:11:49.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow. That's perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.10,0:11:52.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Then how about you join my crew?\NI've been looking to recruit a navigator.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.44,0:11:53.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.44,0:11:53.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.94,0:11:55.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can be our newest crew member!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.57,0:11:57.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.53,0:12:01.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I suppose this means you're a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.53,0:12:02.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.12,0:12:03.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I made a solemn promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.70,0:12:06.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I promised the guy who gave me\Nthis hat that I'd form a crew,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.41,0:12:08.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and become the greatest pirate ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.96,0:12:12.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's nothing in this world\Nthat I despise more than pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.00,0:12:13.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I only like money and tangerines!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.96,0:12:15.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.13,0:12:16.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Be our navigator.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.13,0:12:17.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I said no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.38,0:12:19.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.05,0:12:22.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you find her or what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.72,0:12:24.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! I can't find her anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.52,0:12:25.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where could she be hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.98,0:12:29.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I don't know, but we're gonna be\Nin big trouble if we don't get that chart back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.56,0:12:32.90,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I gotta do something about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.23,0:12:38.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I guess I might consider joining you,\Nbut only if you'll agree to certain conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.70,0:12:40.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really? I'll do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.53,0:12:44.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Well then, I want you to come with me\Nto pay a little visit to Buggy the Pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.29,0:12:45.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But first...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.29,0:12:50.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why did you have to tie me up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.50,0:12:52.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The rope's just for appearances.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.79,0:12:54.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, okay then...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.30,0:12:57.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've been looking forward to meeting\Nsome other pirates, so let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.67,0:13:00.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just hold your horses!\NWhat's the big rush?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.13,0:13:02.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.93,0:13:04.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me\Nthe thief got away?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.60,0:13:08.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please forgive us, Captain Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.73,0:13:11.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've never seen a more\Npathetic group than you three!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.98,0:13:13.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.36,0:13:16.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy, I have news!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.48,0:13:17.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ugh. What is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.86,0:13:20.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The girl who stole our chart is back,\Nand with a prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.61,0:13:21.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.91,0:13:24.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's her!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.66,0:13:27.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the sneaky thief\Nwho stole the chart!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.37,0:13:35.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've captured the thief,\NCaptain Buggy the Clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.38,0:13:37.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And here's your chart back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.34,0:13:39.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not that I don't appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.51,0:13:42.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But... why the sudden\Nchange of heart, little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.76,0:13:48.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I had another fight with my boss,\Nand I just can't take it anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.81,0:13:51.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So I thought I'd see\Nif I could join your crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.07,0:14:00.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're fed up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.44,0:14:02.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I must admit, you're an amusing girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.45,0:14:04.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I like you! Of course\Nyou can join my crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.87,0:14:11.91,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I've successfully infiltrated them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.91,0:14:14.12,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Pirates are so dumb\Nand easy to manipulate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.04,0:14:17.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, why am I in a cage?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.46,0:14:22.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a great day to be a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.55,0:14:24.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Girl, what do you call yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.80,0:14:26.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.18,0:14:27.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.30,0:14:30.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then let's have a welcome party\Nfor our new friend Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.06,0:14:31.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's celebrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.12,0:14:50.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.24,0:14:53.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're throwing this party\Nin your honor, so eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.21,0:14:56.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the party, Captain Buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.17,0:15:01.09,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll just keep my eyes peeled\Nfor a chance to take back that chart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.09,0:15:04.72,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll swipe all of Buggy's\Ntreasure, too, while I'm at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.68,0:15:08.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.60,0:15:20.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is such a flashy party.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.07,0:15:21.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.57,0:15:25.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Men, it's time\Nto prepare the Buggy Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.21,0:15:44.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All set, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.38,0:15:47.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you\Ndoing with that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.97,0:15:50.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just observe... the awesome\Nmight of the Buggy Ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.97,0:15:51.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Light it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.45,0:16:15.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was one heck of an explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.29,0:16:18.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It looked like it was one of\Nthe Captain's beloved Buggy Balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.33,0:16:20.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Buggy Balls?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.10,0:16:34.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was flashy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.14,0:16:36.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,With these Buggy Balls\Nand my devil fruit powers,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.77,0:16:39.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I should have no problem\Nconquering the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.85,0:16:41.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.06,0:16:42.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right! Yes, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.98,0:16:43.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.98,0:16:45.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.28,0:16:48.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But it's my destiny to\Nconquer the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.16,0:16:52.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And then I'm gonna become\NKing of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.57,0:16:54.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.25,0:16:59.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can see why\Nyou're sick of him, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.87,0:17:01.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.17,0:17:04.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He never takes anything seriously,\Nthinks that life's a big game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.55,0:17:06.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He acts like a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.76,0:17:08.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.84,0:17:13.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then how about I give you a Buggy\NBall to blow away your old boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.72,0:17:14.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.64,0:17:19.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}It'll be a great opportunity for you to prove\Nyour loyalty to me, your new captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.77,0:17:20.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.44,0:17:31.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}That's all right, Captain.\NWe don't have to finish him off quite yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.20,0:17:34.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's get back to the welcoming\Nparty and just have more fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.29,0:17:38.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is my idea of having more fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.92,0:17:44.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}– Fire! Fire! Fire!\N– Fire! Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.75,0:17:48.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Fire! Fire! Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.05,0:17:49.84,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,If I don't shoot, I'll be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.63,0:17:56.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Fire! Fire! Fire! Fire! Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.63,0:17:54.68,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,But if I do shoot, then\NI'm no better than these pirates...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.81,0:17:57.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.56,0:17:58.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Light the fuse, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.97,0:18:03.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fire! Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.19,0:18:07.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fire! Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.02,0:18:10.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fire! Fire! Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.99,0:18:11.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.86,0:18:13.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're not wimping out on me, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.78,0:18:17.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.95,0:18:19.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your hands are shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.20,0:18:25.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's what happens when you take\Non pirates with half-assed resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.54,0:18:27.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Resolve? To do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.79,0:18:30.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To kill someone like it's nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.01,0:18:31.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that a pirate's resolve?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.38,0:18:32.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.72,0:18:35.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fire! Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.59,0:18:37.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You gotta be willing\Nto risk your own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.97,0:18:40.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fire! Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.81,0:18:43.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fire! Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.19,0:18:45.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here, new chick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.85,0:18:47.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Quit bein' sucha tease.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.44,0:18:49.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let me show you how\Nto light the cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.66,0:19:01.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My mistake... Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.62,0:19:03.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.58,0:19:06.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this outrage?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.12,0:19:07.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.13,0:19:09.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?! Just shoot him already!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.88,0:19:10.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.88,0:19:13.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So... now you've decided to save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.51,0:19:14.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't be so stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.88,0:19:17.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not doing this for you, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.34,0:19:21.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just don't want to lower myself\Nto the level of these inhuman pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.01,0:19:23.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay. Thanks anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.10,0:19:25.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pirates took the life of\Na person very dear to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.44,0:19:27.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll never be one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.31,0:19:29.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.03,0:19:33.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami! The fuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.15,0:19:37.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So you think pirates are just\Ninhuman filth, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.61,0:19:38.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get her, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.96,0:19:51.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Water, water, water, water, water!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.51,0:19:57.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ohh. Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.60,0:20:05.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.27,0:20:12.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.62,0:20:22.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.70,0:20:26.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not very nice of you guys\Nto gang up on the poor girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.08,0:20:28.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.79,0:20:29.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.84,0:20:36.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.88,0:20:39.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I said, are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.59,0:20:42.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh, no, I'm fine, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.22,0:20:44.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whew, what a relief!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.39,0:20:46.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you found us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.02,0:20:48.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now hurry up and come\Nget me out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.02,0:20:50.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How do you keep getting\Nyourself into these situations?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.35,0:20:53.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,First a bird flies off with you,\Nand now I find you trapped in a cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.90,0:20:56.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's an interesting story, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.65,0:20:57.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.90,0:21:00.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah... That little brat\Njust called him Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.99,0:21:06.08,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,The crew he mentioned earlier...\Nwas the Pirate Hunter Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.08,0:21:09.08,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.08,0:21:10.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So you're Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.46,0:21:15.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you're here for my head,\Nyou've got quite a struggle before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.84,0:21:17.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No. Not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.84,0:21:19.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I gave up pirate hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.55,0:21:21.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm here for my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.72,0:21:23.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I'm interested, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.47,0:21:26.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Killing you would\Nbolster my reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.81,0:21:29.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you try... you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.02,0:21:31.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh. Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.65,0:21:36.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I tried to warn you, but oh well...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.23,0:21:39.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get 'em, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.11,0:21:40.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.74,0:21:45.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Buggy! Buggy! Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.03,0:21:49.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Buggy! Buggy! Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.33,0:21:54.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Buggy! Buggy! Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.29,0:21:57.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Die flashily!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.56,0:22:15.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That wasn't much of\Na fight, now was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.86,0:22:17.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.07,0:22:19.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's weak! Way to go, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.28,0:22:20.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.16,0:22:32.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, why are they laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.58,0:22:36.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Their captain is lying dead on the ground\Nand yet they're still laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.21,0:22:37.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.29,0:22:38.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.63,0:22:40.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you find so damn funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.06,0:22:50.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.64,0:22:53.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Buggy's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.06,0:22:54.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the... hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.11,0:23:02.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Chop-Chop Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.11,0:23:06.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the name of the devil fruit\Nthat's given me my powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.28,0:23:10.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm a Chop-Chop person, and now\NI can never be defeated by the sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.71,0:23:15.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His limbs... reattach?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.92,0:23:19.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}And I always thought that the devil fruits\Nwere just a story that pirates told.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.71,0:23:21.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So he's a Chop-Chop man?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.30,0:23:22.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's pretty freaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.93,0:23:29.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I didn't hit any vital organs,\Nbut that's a serious wound you have there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.60,0:23:30.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So I'm guessing...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.64,0:23:33.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– that I am the winner!\N– Buggy! Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.02,0:23:37.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Buggy! Buggy! Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.44,0:23:39.36,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.36,0:23:41.07,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,The tables have turned.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.07,0:23:44.95,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,If we don't do something quick,\Nthey're gonna kill all three of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.20,0:23:47.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I let my guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.57,0:23:49.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stupid mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.62,0:23:57.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Buggy! Buggy! Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.67,0:24:02.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stabbing him in the back was\Na cowardly move, you Big Nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.76,0:24:08.05,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,You idiot! Don't call him that!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.05,0:24:09.34,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,What're you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.35,0:24:15.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's that... you... said?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.85,0:24:17.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who's got a big nose?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.19,0:24:19.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.69,0:24:22.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.23,0:24:27.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kick your ass\Nsoon as I get out of this cage!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.53,0:24:33.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You kick my ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.12,0:24:34.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You've got a lot of nerve, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.79,0:24:40.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}No, I'm afraid all three of you\Nare going to die here today, by my own hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.08,0:24:44.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}So if you're going to do any ass kicking,\Nyou better do it soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.63,0:24:50.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're done for. It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.76,0:24:55.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I refuse to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.72,0:24:57.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro! Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.31,0:24:58.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.31,0:25:01.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You better have a really good\Nplan or else we're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.56,0:25:04.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So what are you guys gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.99,0:25:10.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.24,0:25:12.37,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Nothing makes sense anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.37,0:25:15.08,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,This is why I hate pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.08,0:25:18.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Impudent fool! Time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.46,0:25:27.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your Three-Sword Style\Nhas no effect on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.76,0:25:33.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I already told you I'm... Hey!\NListen when I'm talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.11,0:25:52.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crap, the cannon's pointed at us! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.41,0:25:55.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Light it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.16,0:25:55.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.83,0:25:57.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Do it now!\N– Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.45,0:25:59.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait! Just wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.54,0:26:01.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The cannon's still loaded\Nwith a special Buggy Ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.92,0:26:04.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna go out like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.04,0:26:05.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Done in by my own balls!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.71,0:26:09.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you just did that,\Nyou ungrateful little girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.92,0:26:10.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.76,0:26:12.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,N-N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.01,0:26:12.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.72,0:26:14.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.48,0:26:32.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You okay, Zoro?\NHow bad are you injured?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.57,0:26:34.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just shut up and don't\Nworry about how I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.82,0:26:36.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I need to concentrate if\NI'm gonna get us outta this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.21,0:26:45.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who is... this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.67,0:26:50.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, who's this?\NWho's the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.67,0:26:53.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. She's our new navigator.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.34,0:26:55.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.84,0:26:57.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who are you guys, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.47,0:27:00.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Move...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.81,0:27:02.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.45,0:27:18.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess even a lowly pirate...\Ncan still rescue his friend.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=33}========================== DIALOGUE ==================================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=0}======================== TITLE & SIGNS ================================
